  "body": "Closes #4620.\n\n## Problem\n`GET /api/actions.json?state=all` returned `{\"actions\": []}` while the actions store held applied history: the handler passed the `state` query value straight into a literal `a.state === state` filter, and no action ever has state `\"all\"`. Audit/retrospective consumers (the weekly triage retrospective) read a false zero.\n\n## Fix\n- `state=all` is now the explicit all-history read (no state filter applied).\n- Any other `state` value that is not a real action state (`new`, `applied`, `rejected`, `superseded`) returns 400 instead of a silent empty list, so a mistyped filter cannot masquerade as \"no history\".\n- `ACTION_STATES` is exported from `src/actions.ts` and reused by the handler.\n- `?state=new` behaviour is unchanged.\n\n## Tests\nNew regression test in `test/actions.test.ts`: posts an action, applies it, then pins that `?state=all` and `?state=applied` return it, `?state=new` does not, and `?state=bogus` is a 400.\n\nLocal (laptop): `bun test test/actions.test.ts` — 26 pass, 0 fail (run with `PM_AGG_FRESHNESS_PORT=4899` because the live aggregator holds the default IPC port 4871 on that host).\n\nQueue task 13245, lane code-c.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796730920&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7669&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7669&signature=c2fa56800ba6ed631307b9587890174102d6c34fe2ed1e9981928825f720358d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7669?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
